I believe that (except for Speed) there is only one way to get rid of
intrinsics:  Annoy your God enough to have them taken from you.  There
is a gray area between 'you feel a holy terror' and 'you are killed by
a holy wrath'.  If you can manage to annoy your god and survive, you
might be able to lose your random teleport (after losing such things
as fire/cold/poison resistance....)
I am sure, however, that this approach will not work for Aggravate Monster.

In other words: once you have an intrinsic, you're pretty much stuck with it.

